    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438432
    m_Key: Ward of the Vanquished
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438433
    m_Key: Etched with the names of the fallen. When you tip toward death, their
      fury floods you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438434
    m_Key: Vow of Ruin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438435
    m_Key: An oath written in obsidian. Each fallen foe turns the next blow heavier.
